					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>3230999</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>A 31-year-old starship janitor named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Custodio&lt;/color&gt; is calling from nearby. He admits he profaned a peace ritual between &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Trogo Nation&lt;/color&gt; and &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Bomb Terrorists&lt;/color&gt;. Now they are both chasing him!

He begs for safety and offers to join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Eden&lt;/color&gt;.

If you accept &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Custodio&lt;/color&gt;, both &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Trogo Nation&lt;/color&gt; and &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Bomb Terrorists&lt;/color&gt; will raid you in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;8 hours&lt;/color&gt;.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Custodio&lt;/color&gt; is too frantic to offer more information.</description>
